{
 "source": "m_003002.bin",
 "format": "mz-scene",
 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x12c0",
   "off": 4800,
   "max": 56,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "龍馬達が騒がしく\\n練習をしていた頃\\n京の嵐山では……",
   "en": "While Ryoma and\\nthe others were\\nnoisily practicing,\\nin Arashiyama,\\nKyoto...",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0819"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x194c",
   "off": 6476,
   "max": 64,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "おやおや　今日も満員だ\\nみんな　他にすることが\\nないんだね～",
   "en": "My, my, a full\\nhouse again\\ntoday. I guess\\nnone of them\\nhave anything\\nbetter to do~",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x081a"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x199c",
   "off": 6556,
   "max": 40,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "ホント\\nうるさいなぁ……\\n耳障りな声だ",
   "en": "Honestly, so\\nnoisy... What a\\ngrating sound.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x081b"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x19d4",
   "off": 6612,
   "max": 44,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "ふん……\\n見渡す限りのクズって\\nところかな",
   "en": "Hmph... Trash\\nas far as the eye\\ncan see, I'd say.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x081c"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x1a10",
   "off": 6672,
   "max": 68,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "クズがさえずるための\\n口なんて削いでしまった\\n方がいいと思うけど",
   "en": "If you ask me,\\ntrash that chirps\\nlike that ought to\\nhave its mouths\\nsliced right off.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x081d"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x23fc",
   "off": 9212,
   "max": 12,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "…………",
   "en": "......",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x081e"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x2c68",
   "off": 11368,
   "max": 16,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "あ　土方さん",
   "en": "Ah, Hijikata-san.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x081f"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x2c88",
   "off": 11400,
   "max": 48,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "楽屋で休んでると\\n思ったのに\\nどうしたんです？",
   "en": "I thought you\\nwere resting\\nin the dressing\\nroom. What's\\nthe matter?",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0820"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x3134",
   "off": 12596,
   "max": 24,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "お前こそ\\n何をしている",
   "en": "I could ask\\nyou the same.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0821"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x35c8",
   "off": 13768,
   "max": 52,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "煌（ファン）の\\n興奮を　少しでも\\n肌で感じたくて？",
   "en": "Wanting to\\nfeel the fans'\\nexcitement on\\nmy skin, even\\njust a little?",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0822"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x360c",
   "off": 13836,
   "max": 24,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "なーんてね\\nふふ……",
   "en": "Just kidding.\\nHeh...",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0823"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x3aa0",
   "off": 15008,
   "max": 24,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "お前はあいかわらずだな",
   "en": "You never\\nchange.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0824"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x3f34",
   "off": 16180,
   "max": 12,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "うふふ……",
   "en": "Hehehe...",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0825"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x4834",
   "off": 18484,
   "max": 48,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "ここで何を言っても許す\\nだが雷舞は真剣にやれ",
   "en": "Say what you like\\nhere. But take\\nthe live seriously.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0826"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x4874",
   "off": 18548,
   "max": 36,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "新選組の恥は\\n近藤さんの恥となる",
   "en": "The\\nShinsengumi's\\nshame is\\nKondo-san's\\nshame.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0827"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x4fb4",
   "off": 20404,
   "max": 24,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "もちろんわかってますよ",
   "en": "Of course I\\nknow that.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0828"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x4fdc",
   "off": 20444,
   "max": 48,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "僕が舞台の上で醜態を\\n晒すわけがないでしょ？",
   "en": "There's no way\\nI'd disgrace\\nmyself on\\nstage, is there?",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0829"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x501c",
   "off": 20508,
   "max": 56,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "それ以上に\\n近藤さんや土方さんに\\n恥をかかせるなんて",
   "en": "Much less bring\\nshame on\\nKondo-san or you,\\nHijikata-san...",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x082a"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x56d4",
   "off": 22228,
   "max": 20,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "ありえないですよ",
   "en": "That's\\nunthinkable.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x082b"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x5f48",
   "off": 24392,
   "max": 44,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "ああ　そうだな\\nお前のことは信用している",
   "en": "Right. I trust you.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x082c"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x6488",
   "off": 25736,
   "max": 8,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "はい",
   "en": "Yes.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x082d"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x690c",
   "off": 26892,
   "max": 44,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "この分だと　今日も\\n客の入りは良いようだな",
   "en": "Looks like\\nanother good\\nturnout today.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x082e"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x6954",
   "off": 26964,
   "max": 40,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "この泰平の世を守れるのは\\n徳川幕府のみ",
   "en": "Only the\\nTokugawa\\nshogunate can\\nprotect this\\nera of peace.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x082f"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x7104",
   "off": 28932,
   "max": 56,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "俺達の歌で\\n幕府への忠義の心を\\n奴らに　叩き込んでやれ",
   "en": "Use our songs to\\nhammer loyalty\\nto the shogunate\\ninto them.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0830"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x77d4",
   "off": 30676,
   "max": 20,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "はい\\nもちろんです",
   "en": "Yes. Of course.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0831"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x7ee0",
   "off": 32480,
   "max": 72,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "俺達の天歌は　幕府の……\\n近藤さんの夢を叶える\\nためにあるのだからな\\n",
   "en": "Our Heaven's\\nSong exists to\\nmake the\\nshogunate's... to\\nmake Kondo-san's\\ndream come true.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0832"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x83a4",
   "off": 33700,
   "max": 40,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "ええ　土方さん\\n今日も頑張りましょう",
   "en": "Yes, Hijikata-san.\\nLet's give it our\\nall today too.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0833"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x8848",
   "off": 34888,
   "max": 8,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "ああ",
   "en": "Mm.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0834"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x9008",
   "off": 36872,
   "max": 56,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "土方さんと近藤さんが\\n望むものが\\n泰平の世　ならば……",
   "en": "If what\\nHijikata-san\\nand Kondo-san\\nwant is an era\\nof peace...",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0835"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x9050",
   "off": 36944,
   "max": 56,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "どんなことをしても\\nそれをこの世に実現して\\nみせるよ",
   "en": "...then I'll make it\\nreal in this world,\\nwhatever it takes.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0836"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x9708",
   "off": 38664,
   "max": 24,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "それが僕の生きている証",
   "en": "That's my proof\\nthat I'm alive.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0837"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x9744",
   "off": 38724,
   "max": 52,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "くだらない\\n生き物を相手に\\nすることだとしてもね",
   "en": "Even if it\\nmeans dealing\\nwith worthless\\ncreatures.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0838"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0xa35c",
   "off": 41820,
   "max": 24,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "すごい歓声ぜよ……！",
   "en": "What a roar from\\nthe crowd...!",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0839"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0xa9b8",
   "off": 43448,
   "max": 36,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "ちっ　こんなのに\\n呑まれんな　バカ",
   "en": "Tch. Don't let\\nthis swallow\\nyou up, idiot.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x083a"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0xb078",
   "off": 45176,
   "max": 56,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "予想外ですね\\n女の子だけではなくて\\n男性客も多いですよ",
   "en": "How unexpected.\\nIt isn't just girls--\\nthere are plenty\\nof men here too.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x083b"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0xbdbc",
   "off": 48572,
   "max": 32,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "きゃーーっ！\\n土方様ーーーっ！",
   "en": "Kyaaa!\\nHijikata-samaaa!",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x083c"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0xc258",
   "off": 49752,
   "max": 44,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "おおおおおーーー！\\n総司くぅぅぅーーん！\\n",
   "en": "Ooooooh!\\nSoji-kuuuun!",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x083d"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0xc998",
   "off": 51608,
   "max": 40,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "会場は老若男女で\\n埋め尽くされていた",
   "en": "The venue was\\npacked with\\npeople young\\nand old, men\\nand women alike.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x083e"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0xcfb8",
   "off": 53176,
   "max": 72,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "各世代に支持されていると\\nいう話は　眉唾かと思って\\nいましたけれど……",
   "en": "I had thought\\nthe claims about\\nfans of every\\ngeneration were\\ndubious, but...",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x083f"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0xd010",
   "off": 53264,
   "max": 40,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "予想に反して\\n噂は事実だったようですね",
   "en": "Contrary to my\\nexpectations,\\nthe rumors\\nseem to be true.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0840"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0xd4b4",
   "off": 54452,
   "max": 12,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "……ちっ！",
   "en": "...Tch!",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0841"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0xdc44",
   "off": 56388,
   "max": 48,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "おおー！\\n歓声にも　熱気が\\nこもってるなぁ！",
   "en": "Whoa! There's\\nreal heat in\\nthese cheers!",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0842"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0xdc84",
   "off": 56452,
   "max": 24,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "うう～～\\n楽しみぜよ！",
   "en": "Ooh, I can't wait!",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0843"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0xdcac",
   "off": 56492,
   "max": 76,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "これだけの人間を虜にする\\n新選組の歌には　熱い魂が\\nあるに　違いないぜよ！",
   "en": "Shinsengumi\\nsongs that can\\nhook this many\\npeople--there's\\ngotta be a burnin'\\nsoul in 'em!",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0844"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0xe33c",
   "off": 58172,
   "max": 40,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "……だといいがな\\nいや　よくはねえが",
   "en": "...Hope so. No,\\nwait, I don't.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0845"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0xea00",
   "off": 59904,
   "max": 36,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "それを　これから\\n確かめるんですよ",
   "en": "That's what we're\\nabout to find out.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0846"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0xf018",
   "off": 61464,
   "max": 28,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "おお！\\n始まるぜよ……！",
   "en": "Whoa! It's\\nstartin'...!",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0847"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0xf4c4",
   "off": 62660,
   "max": 52,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "龍馬が期待に胸膨らます中\\n新選組の雷舞は幕を開けた",
   "en": "As Ryoma's heart\\nswelled with\\nanticipation, the\\nShinsengumi live\\nbegan.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0848"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0xf508",
   "off": 62728,
   "max": 68,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "煙幕がかかる中\\n舞台の上に新選組の\\n隊士らしき人影が\\n走り出て行く",
   "en": "Through a\\nsmokescreen,\\nfigures that\\nseemed to be\\nShinsengumi\\nmembers\\ndashed out\\nonto the stage.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0849"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0xff20",
   "off": 65312,
   "max": 16,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "きゃーーーー！",
   "en": "Kyaaaaa!",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x084a"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x103ac",
   "off": 66476,
   "max": 24,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "新選組よーーーっ！\\n",
   "en": "It's the\\nShinsengumiii!",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x084b"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x10d50",
   "off": 68944,
   "max": 48,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "まだ姿を現さんのに\\nこんなに盛り上がるとは……",
   "en": "They ain't even\\nshown up yet,\\nand the crowd's\\nthis fired up...",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x084c"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x10d90",
   "off": 69008,
   "max": 36,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "新選組は　本当に\\nすごいもんぜよ",
   "en": "The Shinsengumi\\nsure are\\nsomethin', I tell\\nya.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x084d"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x11400",
   "off": 70656,
   "max": 20,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "感心してる場合か！",
   "en": "This is no time\\nto be impressed!",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x084e"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x11ab0",
   "off": 72368,
   "max": 44,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "まぁ　感心したくも\\nなりますよ　これじゃ",
   "en": "Well, with this,\\none can't help\\nbeing impressed.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x084f"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x12058",
   "off": 73816,
   "max": 24,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "桂がそう呟くのも道理",
   "en": "No wonder\\nKatsura\\nmuttered that.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0850"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x12080",
   "off": 73856,
   "max": 92,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "大きな建物いっぱいに\\n渦巻く熱気は\\n開始直後であるにも\\nかかわらず\\n最高潮まで達していた",
   "en": "The heat swirling\\nthrough the\\ngreat building\\nhad already\\nreached its peak,\\neven though the\\nshow had only\\njust begun.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0851"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x12660",
   "off": 75360,
   "max": 36,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "どんな演奏をするのか\\n楽しみぜよ～",
   "en": "Can't wait to see\\nhow they play!",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0852"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x12b00",
   "off": 76544,
   "max": 48,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "おい　龍馬\\nオレ様達は敵情視察に\\n来てるだけだ",
   "en": "Hey, Ryoma.\\nWe're only here to\\nscout the enemy.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0853"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x12b40",
   "off": 76608,
   "max": 44,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "楽しみにきたんじゃねえ\\nそれを忘れるなよ",
   "en": "We didn't come\\nto have fun.\\nDon't forget that.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0854"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x130e8",
   "off": 78056,
   "max": 44,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "その時\\n龍馬達に近づく\\n一つの人影があった",
   "en": "Just then,\\na figure\\napproached\\nRyoma and\\nthe others.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0855"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x1392c",
   "off": 80172,
   "max": 44,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "おや？　おまえさんたち\\n初めて見る顔だな",
   "en": "Oh? Haven't seen\\nyour faces around\\nhere before.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0856"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x140b8",
   "off": 82104,
   "max": 24,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "誰ぜよ\\nお前さんは？",
   "en": "And who might\\nyou be, pal?",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0857"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x145e8",
   "off": 83432,
   "max": 52,
   "kind": "dialogue",
