   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x08da"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_003002:0x42d60",
   "off": 273760,
   "max": 56,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "坂本龍馬よ\\nおまえに　俺達新選組の\\n本気を見せてやろう",
   "en": "Ryoma Sakamoto.\\nWe of the\\nShinsengumi will\\nshow you what\\nwe've really got.",
